sequenceDiagram
    actor Me
    participant Browser as Browser
    participant Key as Authenticator
    participant IdP as ZITADEL
    Note over Key,IdP: Registration stores a public key at ZITADEL
    Me->>Browser: Sign in with passkey
    Browser->>IdP: Request authentication
    IdP-->>Browser: Fresh challenge and RP options
    Browser->>Key: Request assertion for this RP
    Key->>Me: Ask for local confirmation
    Me-->>Key: Confirm
    Key-->>Browser: Signed assertion
    Browser->>IdP: Submit assertion
    IdP->>IdP: Verify signature, challenge, origin and RP
    IdP-->>Browser: Authentication succeeds
